SUMMARY:Durham Forest\, South Entrance - Intermediate Hike
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nDurham Forest is one of the few untouched 
 areas remaining in the GTA. We will do a large loop enjoying many scenic v
 iews. It's a great time of year to hike the rolling hills just before the 
 forest explodes with spring colours. We may see the first Trilliums of the
  season.\n\nOnce we finish the hike\, for those who are interested\, we ca
 n do lunch at the Hub Restaurant\, which overlooks the valleys below.\n\nT
 he pace will be moderate\, taking breaks along the way. We can adjust as n
 eeded. The length of the hike is roughly 9 -10 km. Come out and enjoy the 
 fresh air and take in some forest bathing.\n\n**Note**\n\n* Arrive on time
 ! Cancel if you can't make it.\n* Know your limits! Hike within your fitne
 ss level.\n* Dress for the conditions.\n* Proper footwear is required.\n* 
 Be aware and prepared for ticks.\n* Free Parking.\n* No Dogs.\n* The hike 
 will be canceled if the weather doesn't cooperate.\n\n**We promptly leave 
 at\n9:07 am.**\n\nHope to see you there!\n\nYou MUST respond with a YES to
  the Hike Question in order to participate.\n\n**LEGAL DISCLAIMER AND LIAB
 ILITY INFORMATION:**\n\nBy RSVP'ing and paying the event fee (if applicabl
 e)\, you are confirming that you have read\, understand and accept the fol
 lowing:\n\n1. GTA Hiking Meetup is a private group. Attending events is vo
 luntary by you as a member. Participation in any activity with us is at yo
 ur own risk.\n2. By joining this event as a member you agree to indemnify 
 and hold harmless its organizers\, co-organizers\, assistant organizers\, 
 event hosts\, and other members from all claims or liability of every type
  (including court costs and legal fees) for injury or death to any person 
 or for damage to property\, loss of personal property or any other wrongfu
 l act arising out of or relating to your participation as a member. This a
 greement applies to you and to other persons (as your guests) who may acco
 mpany you in these endeavors.\n3. You also agree to hold the organizers as
  well as other group members harmless. By participating voluntarily in the
  group\, you expressly waive any and all such claims against each and ever
 y other member in the group\, including without limitation any and all cla
 ims against the group organizer\, co-organizers\, assistant organizers\, a
 nd event hosts.
