SUMMARY:AWENDA PROVINCIAL PARK! HIKE & BEACH MEETUP (with a lunch potluck)
  ⛱️
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\n🌞 Saturday Adventure: *Scenic Walk + Be
 ach Day* at Awenda Park 🥾🏖️\n\n📍 Location: Awenda Park (FREE Pa
 rking!) - normally $20.00\n🚶‍♀️ Distance: 15 km round trip\, flat
  trails and suitable for strong beginners looking for a challenge on dista
 nce\n⏳ End Time: Around 6:30 PM (flexible — stay as long as you want a
 t the beach!)\n\n*What’s the Plan?*\nWe’ll start with an easy\, beginn
 er-friendly walk through *shaded forest trails*\, making our way to beauti
 ful Kettle Lake. From there\, we’ll continue to the Beach\, where we’l
 l relax\, swim\, and have a potluck lunch (bring something to share).\n\nA
 fter lunch\, we will hang out at the beach for about 1 hour before we hike
  back together.\n\nWhy You’ll Love It:\n✅ Beginner-friendly pace — p
 erfect if you’re new to hiking\n✅ Relaxing beach time to cool off afte
 r the walk\n✅ Potluck picnic — great way to try new food & meet new fr
 iends\n✅ Free parking — easy to get here\n✅ Flexible timing — leav
 e when you’re ready\n\n**What you need to bring:**\n\n1. Pack at least 8
  cups of water\n2. Potluck lunch item or snacks to share (OPTIONAL)\n3. To
 wel\, swimwear\, beach stuff\n4. Comfortable walking or hiking shoes\n5. P
 ositive vibes 😎\n\n**Hike Includes:**\n*free parking\n*a relaxed pace h
 ike (we are NOT a fast hiking group). We wait for everyone and slow down w
 hen needed\, stop and take breaks as needed. We are a diverse and inclusiv
 e hiking group!\n\n**MEETING SPOT:**\nLocation TBA\n\n**MEETING TIME:**\nW
 e meet at 11:00am and start walking at 11:10am.\n\n**30 SPOTS**\nThis meet
 up will be capped at 30 spots.\n\nHikes are led by a certified personal tr
 ainer and group fitness instructor also certified in emergency first aid a
 nd CPR training.\n\n**Cancelation policy:**\nUPDATE your RSVP to not going
  if you can not attend.\n\n**Hike Rules:**\n\n- no smoking on trails\n*be 
 kind and respectful\n- arrive on time\n*no blasting loud music\n- no litte
 ring trails with garbage\n*bring a positive attitude :)\n\nSee you there!\
 n\nChristine Salib\, M.Ed\nCertified Personal Trainer and Fitness Instruct
 or\, PTS\, FIS\, NWS\, MBS\nHike Leader\n\n***Hike leaves promptly at 11:1
 0AM***\n\n\\*\\*\\*YOU MUST UPDATE YOUR RSVP to* NOT Going *if you can not
  attend.\n\n**LEGAL DISCLAIMER AND LIABILITY INFORMATION:**\nBy RSVP'ing a
 nd paying the event fee (if applicable)\, you are confirming that you have
  read\, understand and accept the following:\n\n1. GTA Hiking Meetup is a 
 private group. Attending events is voluntary by you as a member. Participa
 tion in any activity with us is at your own risk.
